TRANSLATION

The Qur'anic verses quoted in this application are from the English translation
by Muhammad Marmaduke Pickthall, "The Meaning of the Glorious Koran" (1930),
which is in the public domain. No copyright is claimed in the translation.
Copyright is claimed in the selection, arrangement, explanation, application and
presentation of those verses, and in the application itself.


